  "reference": "Boisionikab Che Kiyoktoi 7",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 56,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amdaetab Stepano",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole anyun tisiindet ne o, Tos u choto tuguchu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole Stepano, Che kitupche ak kwanisiekyok, ogaso. Kimong’ji Jehovah ne bo torornatet kwandanyo Abraham, ye kimi Mesopotamia, kotomo komeny Haran, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kolenji, Mong’u eng’ emeng’ung’ ak eng’ ole mi biguk, ak inyo emet ne ta aborun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Komong’ anyun eng’ emetab Kaldeik, ak komeny Haran: ak kingo kagome kwandanyi, kouu Jehovah inendet, konyo emonito omenye rani: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kima igochi inendet borotet eng’ oloto, acha, agot ole indoi keldanyi: ak kiiarorji kole, tun igochin inendet ak iyotennyi eng’ let, ye kitom kosich lakwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimwa Jehovah ko u ni, kole, Egu lagokyik bunotik eng’ emetab bik alak, ak koyai ichek koek otwogik, ak koyachi ne ya eng’ kenyisiek bogol ang’wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimwa Jehovah, kole, Aruokyini bororionoto ne tun ratei ichek: ak ye ibata noto komong’ ak koboisiewa eng’ olito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiigochi arorutiet ne bo kamuratanet: kosich anyun Abraham Isak, ak komuratan inendet eng’ betut ne bo sisiit; ak kosich Isak Jakobo, ak kisich Jakobo kwanisiekyok taman ak aeng’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kingoam ng’et kong’ boisiechoto agobo Josep, koalda inendet kwo Misri: ak kimi Jehovah koboto inendet, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kisor inendet eng’ nyalilwogikyik tugul, ak kogochi chamet ak ng’omnatet eng’ taitab Parao laitoriatab Misri; ne kiinde inendet koek bounindet eng’ Misri ak gonnyi tugul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinyo anyun rubet Misri komugul ak Kanan, ak nyalilda ne o: ak manyor kwanisiekyok amitwogik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago ye kingogas Jakobo kole mitei bek Misri, koyokto kwanisiekyok eng’ banda ne bo tai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eng’ banda ne bo aeng’ koborjigei Josep tupchosiekyik; ak kinaak eng’ Parao bikab Josep. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiiyokto Josep kole keguur kwandanyi Jakobo, ak bikyik tugul, bik tamanwogik tisab ak mut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kochortagei anyun Jakobo kwo Misri; ak kime, inendet, ak kwanisiekyok; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kigila ichek koba Sekem, ak kigitupchi kererit ne kiga al Abraham eng’ kamanutietab feda eng’ werikab Hamor eng’ Sekem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kingorik betut ne bo arorutiet, ne kiiyosiechi Jehovah Abraham, koyabak bik ak kotesogis eng’ Misri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "agoi kobiit laitoriat age eng’ Misri, ne kima kongen Josep. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "King’omenji inendet bororiennyo, ak koyachi ne ya kwanisiekyok, si kolakta manyurunikwak si masopcho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kigisich Musa eng’ betusiechoto, ak ki kararan inendet mising’; ak kigigu eng’ gotab kwandanyi arawek somok; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kingo kagemeto, konyo chebo Parao, komut, ak kogu koek werinnyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiginet Musa ng’omnatet tugul ne bo Misrik; ak ki kim eng’ ng’alekyik ak boisionikyik.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kingoit olo bo kenyisiek artam, kobwat eng’ muguleldanyi korutochi tupchosiekyik, lagokab Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kingogeer kinyalili age eng’ ichek, kotoret inendet, ak koyaaktochi mugetut inendet ne kaginyalili, kokwer Misrindet kobar: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kilen inendet naei tupchosiekyik kole igochin Jehovah ichek sorunet eng’ eunnyi; ago ma nai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eng’ betut ne isubi noto kochunji ichek kobortos, ak iimachei kooiyo ichek, kolenji, Murenju, otupche okwek; kalya si oyachige ne ya? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kitoorta inendet ne kiyachi nin age ne ya, ak kole, Ng’o ne koindein iegu bounindet ak kiruogindet kot iruokwech? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imache ibara ko u ye koibar Misrindet amut? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimwee Musa anyun ng’olyondonoto, kwo koek bunotyo eng’ emetab Midian, ole kisikyi werik aeng’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingobata kenyisiek artamu, komong’ji inendet malaikaiyat eng’ ong’atet ne bo tulwetab Sinai, eng’ mat ne lalei eng’ ketit ne samum. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingogeer Musa, kokwong’ eng’ kioto kageer: ak kingorikta kole kogeer, kotwek kutitab Kiptaiyat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kole, A Jehovah ne bo kwanisieguk, Jehovah ne bo Abraham, ak ne bo Isak, ak ne bo Jakobo. Kobotan Musa, ko mata kogany kogeer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolenji Kiptaiyat anyun inendet, Icheru kweoniguk eng’ kelyeguk: amu tilil ng’onyut yoto itonone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiageer iman nyalildab bikyuk che mitei Misri, ak kiagas tigenenywa, ak kaachoruge si kobiit asor ichek: nyo anyun nguno, ayokten iwe Misri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa nito ne kiesio ichek, kolen, Ng’o ne koindein iegu bounindet ak kiruogindet? Inendet ne kiiyokto Jehovah eng’ eutab malaikaiyat ne kimong’ji inendet eng’ ketit si kobiit koek bounindet, ak katiagindet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiimut chichi anyun ichek komanda, ye kingo kagoyai kwong’utik ak kaborunoik eng’ Misri, ak eng’ Nyanjet ne Birir, ak eng’ kenyisiek artam eng’ ong’atet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa nito ko noto ne kilenji lagokab Israel, Ing’eetwok Jehovah maotiot ne tun bunu che otupche, ne u ane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nito ko inendet ne kimi kaniset eng’ ong’atet koboto malaikaiyat ne king’alalji inendet eng’ tulwet ne bo Sinai, ak koboto kwanisiekyok: ne kitaach ng’alek che soptos si kogonech:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kima kas it kwanisiekyok inendet, ago kiesio inendet, ak kiweektagei mugulelwekwak Misri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kolenji Aron, Yaiywech kanamonik kondoenech: amu magingen ole katepto Musa nito, ne kiimutwech kemong’une emetab Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiyai anyun moita eng’ betusiechoto, ak koipchi tiseiywot kanamwonoto, ak koboiboitu eng’ boisionikab eunekwak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kiituktochi batai Jehovah ichek, ak kogoito ichek koot lugetab kipsengwet; ko u ye sirat eng’ bukuitab maotik, kele,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago mamenyei Inendet ne Toror Mising’ gorik che kiyae eunek; ko u ye mwaei maotiot, kole, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’echerennyu ne bo laitornatet kipsengwet,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwek che uui kaat che ma kimuratan mugulelwek ak itik, ogirindoi Tamirmiriet ne Tilil kotugul: ko u ye kiyaei kwanisiekwok, oyae ak okwek ko u noto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’o eng’ maotik ne ma us kwanisiekwok? Ak kibar che kisib kobor nyonunetab Chito ne bo Imanda; ne kaoegu okwek nguno ng’wektoik ak rumik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwek che kiotaach Ng’atutiet ko u ye kiging’at eng’ malaikaisiek, ak ma orib.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.53"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Meetab Stepano",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kingogas ng’alechuto kong’wonegitu mising’ eng’ mugulelwekwak, ak konyei kelek agobo inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kiinyal kipsengwet kochiilji kong’ ko nyiitat inendet Tamirmiriet ne Tilil, ak kigeer lilindab Jehovah, ak Jesu kotononi eng’ eutab tai ne bo Jehovah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kile, Ogeero, ageere kipsengwetisiek ko kagoyatogis, ak kotononi Weritab chi eng’ eutab tai ne bo Jehovah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.56"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kibolyo eng’ kutit ne o, ak koger itikwak, ak kotorombenji kibagenge; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kitoorta inendet komanda eng’ nganaset, ak kolage koik: ak kiinde baorinik ngoroikwak kelyekab muren age ne kigiguure Saul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolach anyun Stepano, koguurei Kiptaiyat, kolen, Kiptaiyat Jesu, taach tamirmiriennyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 7:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kigutuny, ak komwa eng’ kutit ne o, kole, Kiptaiyat, ameiityi ichek tengegi. Ak kingo kagomwa nito, konuuch.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.7.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.7.60"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
